    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack are delighted to present 18 Cuanahowan, an impressive four bedroom detached family home ideally positioned in this popular residential estate, just a short distance from the many amenities Tullow town has to offer.\n\nThis bright and spacious property provides well appointed accommodation throughout making it an ideal choice for families seeking comfort, space, and convenience. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generous living room, a modern open-plan kitchen/dining area perfect for family living and entertaining, a separate utility room, and a guest WC.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers four well-proportioned bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from a private en-suite, alongside a family bathroom serving the remaining bedrooms.\n\nExternally, the property boasts a driveway providing off-street parking for two cars, complemented by a lawn area to the front. To the rear, the garden is laid out in lawn and is surrounded by a convenient 360° walkway around the property, offering excellent outdoor space and easy access.\n\nLocated in the thriving town of Tullow, residents can enjoy a wide range of amenities including primary and secondary schools, shops, cafés, sports clubs, and local societies. The renowned Mount Wolseley Golf & Country Club is also close by, offering excellent leisure facilities.\n\nTullow is ideally situated with easy access to major urban centres including Carlow, Kilkenny, Naas, Newbridge and Wexford.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space, location, and lifestyle this wonderful home has to offer.\n\nContact DNG McCormack today to arrange a viewing. 0599133800\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit mydng.ie and register."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 2.46 x 3.64\nWood flooring\n\nLiving Room - 3.84 x 4.11\nWood flooring, bay window, solid fuel open fire, double doors to kitchen/diner\n\nKitchen/Diner - 4.46 x 6.39\nTiled flooring, fully fitted units at eye and floor level, tiled splash back, patio doors to rear, island with seating\n\nUtility Room - 1.80 x 2.29\nTiled floring, rear access, tiled splash back, all services\n\nGuest WC - 1.32 x 3.64\nTiled flooring, WC, WHB\n\nLanding - 1.10 x 3.53\nCarpet flooring, attic access\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.99 x 4.11\nCarpet flooring, front aspect, double room\n\nEn-suite - 2.73 x 0.97\nTiled flooring, WC, WHB, shower\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.31 x 2.93\nCarpet flooring, rear aspect, double room\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.25 x 3.76\nCarpet flooring, rear aspect, double room\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.38 x 3.36\nCarpet flooring, front aspect, large single room\n\nBathroom - 3.09 x 1.85\nTiled floor and walls, WC, WHB, bath with shower over\n\n"
